INSERT INTO `surveymemberanswerstbl` VALUES (1,1,1,1,'yes','My favorite NFL football activity! ','2026-08-25 13:55:18'),(2,73,1,1,'yes','','2019-07-22 23:14:30'),(3,73,1,2,'yes','','2019-07-22 23:15:08'),(4,73,1,3,'no','','2019-07-22 23:15:26'),(5,73,1,4,'yes','','2019-07-22 23:15:44'),(6,73,1,5,'yes','','2019-07-22 23:16:16'),(7,73,1,6,'no','I am not savvy enough in the football betting universe to tell you what does/does not need changing. I do however think your site is really good.  Easy to use and I appreciate how much work you put into it.  I like it very much.  Now if I could only win.....','2019-07-22 23:21:40'),(8,73,1,7,'no','It\'s all about \'me\'.  Actually, I didn\'t even know this was on the site, but don\'t go by me.','2019-07-22 23:24:16'),(9,73,1,8,'yes','','2019-07-22 23:24:26'),(10,73,1,9,'no','','2019-07-22 23:24:38'),(11,73,1,10,'no','Unless you can make \'me\' win that most elusive trophy and sweatshirt.','2019-07-22 23:26:02'),(12,73,1,11,'yes','','2019-07-22 23:26:20'),(13,73,1,12,'yes','Mac, IPad.','2019-07-22 23:27:22'),(14,73,1,13,'yes','','2019-07-22 23:27:33'),(15,73,1,14,'yes','','2019-07-22 23:27:43'),(16,73,1,15,'no','','2019-07-22 23:28:01'),(17,73,1,16,'no','','2019-07-22 23:28:08'),(18,73,1,17,'yes','','2019-07-22 23:28:18'),(19,73,1,18,'yes','Not that they know anything.','2019-07-22 23:28:56'),(20,73,1,19,'no','','2019-07-22 23:29:37'),(21,73,1,20,'no','','2019-07-22 23:29:51'),(22,73,1,21,'no','Please don\'t turn into Las Vegas, or worse the Encore.  It\'s fun and simple as it is.  Turn it into a money game and everything changes not for the better.','2019-07-22 23:32:13'),(23,73,1,22,'no','Really, can\'t say with any authority whatsoever.  You should have a third choice like \'huh\'?','2019-07-22 23:34:38'),(24,73,1,23,'yes','Use this all the time.','2019-07-22 23:35:05'),(25,73,1,24,'yes','','2019-07-22 23:35:20'),(26,73,1,25,'no','','2019-07-22 23:35:42'),(27,73,1,26,'yes','Actually, hit no first, but like the cap, so, probably, yes.  What???s behind the motivation however?','2019-07-22 23:38:14'),(28,73,1,27,'no','','2019-07-22 23:38:35'),(29,73,1,28,'no','','2019-07-22 23:38:45'),(30,73,1,29,'yes','I actually emailed Caroline Davis how she was doing so well.  Her husband picks.','2019-07-22 23:42:24'),(31,73,1,30,'no','','2019-07-22 23:42:35'),(32,73,1,31,'no','','2019-07-22 23:42:52'),(33,73,1,32,'yes','Awesome!','2019-07-22 23:43:23'),(34,73,1,33,'no','','2019-07-22 23:43:36'),(35,73,1,34,'yes','','2019-07-22 23:43:47'),(36,73,1,35,'no','','2019-07-22 23:44:06'),(37,73,1,36,'no','','2019-07-22 23:44:29'),(38,73,1,37,'yes','','2019-07-22 23:44:55'),(39,73,1,38,'no','','2019-07-22 23:45:09'),(40,73,1,39,'yes','I get so frustrated but love it.  It\'s all good/bad/good/happy/ annoyed/happy/fun','2019-07-22 23:46:53'),(41,40,1,1,'yes','','2019-07-22 23:55:41'),(42,40,1,2,'no','','2019-07-22 23:55:49'),(43,40,1,3,'yes','','2019-07-22 23:55:58'),(44,40,1,4,'yes','','2019-07-22 23:56:25'),(45,40,1,5,'yes','','2019-07-22 23:57:08'),(46,40,1,6,'no','','2019-07-22 23:57:26'),(47,40,1,7,'no','','2019-07-23 00:25:31'),(48,40,1,8,'yes','','2019-07-23 00:25:32'),(49,40,1,9,'yes','','2019-07-23 00:25:34'),(50,40,1,10,'no','','2019-07-23 00:25:36'),(51,40,1,11,'no','','2019-07-23 00:25:37'),(52,40,1,12,'yes','','2019-07-23 00:25:40'),(53,40,1,13,'yes','','2019-07-23 00:25:42'),(54,40,1,14,'yes','','2019-07-23 00:25:43'),(55,40,1,15,'yes','','2019-07-23 00:25:45'),(56,40,1,16,'no','','2019-07-23 00:25:49'),(57,40,1,17,'yes','','2019-07-23 00:25:50'),(58,40,1,18,'yes','','2019-07-23 00:25:53'),(59,40,1,19,'no','','2019-07-23 00:25:54'),(60,40,1,20,'no','','2019-07-23 00:25:55'),(61,40,1,21,'yes','','2019-07-23 00:25:57'),(62,40,1,22,'no','','2019-07-23 00:25:58'),(63,40,1,23,'yes','','2019-07-23 00:26:00'),(64,40,1,24,'no','','2019-07-23 00:26:00'),(65,40,1,25,'no','','2019-07-23 00:26:03'),(66,40,1,26,'no','','2019-07-23 00:26:05'),(67,40,1,27,'no','','2019-07-23 00:26:06'),(68,40,1,28,'no','','2019-