e which one I should pick.  Only exceptions are the Patriots and the Buccaneers, which I favor regardless of of their stats.','2024-10-10 18:52:17'),(1600,62,1,24,'no','','2024-10-10 18:52:54'),(1601,62,1,25,'no','','2024-10-10 18:53:19'),(1602,62,1,26,'yes','Cool, and rather classy.  Thanks.  Please tell me the total cost, and I\'ll add on 5 years worth of $2 dues I haven\'t paid as I wasn\'t aware of the dues.  Have I been with you for 5 years, or is it longer??','2024-10-10 18:57:02'),(1603,62,1,27,'no','','2024-10-10 18:57:38'),(1604,62,1,28,'no','','2024-10-10 18:58:04'),(1605,62,1,29,'no','','2024-10-10 18:58:18'),(1606,62,1,30,'no','','2024-10-10 18:58:27'),(1607,62,1,31,'no','But I\'ll try it on the 14th week.','2024-10-10 18:59:19'),(1608,62,1,32,'yes','Your Mum was the most impressive win on every front.','2024-10-10 19:00:22'),(1609,62,1,33,'no','','2024-10-10 19:00:33'),(1610,62,1,34,'yes','How many years have I been with you and I\'ll add that to the cost of the cap.  Thanks.','2024-10-10 19:01:32'),(1611,62,1,35,'no','','2024-10-10 19:01:50'),(1612,62,1,36,'no','Just the standings of the Regular Season.','2024-10-10 19:03:03'),(1613,62,1,37,'no','','2024-10-10 19:03:55'),(1614,62,1,38,'no','','2024-10-10 19:04:10'),(1615,62,1,39,'yes','Definately.','2024-10-10 19:04:37'),(1616,25,1,1,'yes','','2026-10-29 16:14:23'),(1617,25,1,2,'no','','2026-10-29 16:15:30'),(1618,25,1,3,'no','','2026-10-29 16:17:02'),(1619,25,1,4,'yes','','2026-10-29 16:18:18'),(1620,25,1,5,'yes','','2026-10-29 16:20:36'),(1621,25,1,6,'no','','2026-10-29 16:21:24'),(1622,25,1,7,'yes','','2026-10-29 16:21:56'),(1623,25,1,8,'yes','','2026-10-29 16:22:34'),(1624,25,1,9,'yes','','2026-10-29 16:23:03'),(1625,25,1,10,'no','','2026-10-29 16:23:43'),(1626,25,1,11,'yes','','2026-10-29 16:24:15'),(1627,25,1,12,'yes','','2026-10-29 16:24:54'),(1628,25,1,13,'no','','2026-10-29 16:25:37'),(1629,25,1,14,'yes','','2026-10-29 16:26:25'),(1630,25,1,15,'no','','2026-10-29 16:27:57'),(1631,25,1,16,'yes'